# 📄 PaperLens – AI-Powered Research Paper Assistant

An AI-powered web application that helps researchers, students, and professionals quickly understand research papers by generating concise, structured summaries from uploaded PDF documents.

🔗 **Live Demo:** https://paperlens-sand.vercel.app

📂 **Repository:** https://github.com/likhithateja123/paperlens

Built as the final capstone project of the **AB Talks 60-Day Claude AI Challenge**, demonstrating the complete Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) from planning and development to deployment.

---

# ✨ Features

- 📄 Upload research papers in PDF format
- 🤖 AI-powered summary generation using Groq LLM
- 📑 Extract text from PDFs using PyPDF
- 📝 Display AI summaries with Markdown support
- 📋 Copy summaries with one click
- 📥 Download summaries as a text file
- ⚡ Responsive React frontend
- 🌐 Fully deployed using Vercel & Render

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|--------|------------|
| Frontend | React, Vite, React Markdown |
| Backend | FastAPI, Python |
| AI | Groq API (Llama Model) |
| PDF Processing | PyPDF |
| Deployment | Vercel, Render |
| Version Control | Git & GitHub |

