# 🚀 Local Development Setup

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/likhithateja123/paperlens.git

cd paperlens
```

## Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend

python -m venv backend-env

backend-env\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Backend runs on:

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

---

## Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend

npm install

npm run dev
```

Frontend runs on:

```
http://localhost:5173
```

